ズや背景もおまかせしますので、自由に描いていただければ嬉しいです！\n\nいくつかのポイントがあります：\n・彼女はクーデレタイプのキャラ\n・オッドアイです（片方が青、もう片方が紫）\n・金色の星型のピアスをつけています\n・頭の右側に羽飾りが2つついています\n\nお時間をいただきありがとうございます。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@snow_snoo_bloom/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f085f58b/uploads/origins/1ada5095-6277-4f4b-ad69-c3e22918dcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6454acd984332aeca8d52879868e2037", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f085f58b/uploads/origins/1ada5095-6277-4f4b-ad69-c3e22918dcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6454acd984332aeca8d52879868e2037, https://si.imgix.net/f085f58b/uploads/origins/1ada5095-6277-4f4b-ad69-c3e22918dcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7e15dc2d5ddf47772d5dbc3639984f40 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f085f58b/uploads/origins/1ada5095-6277-4f4b-ad69-c3e22918dcf6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9379b42070049b9ae9a624cd6fac3f9f 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3389511, "nc": 1}, {"path": "/@snow_snoo_bloom/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d20efa5e/uploads/origins/ea539818-aad8-4c64-a9bc-6b7bf7aa94a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b5f77ba274eeeaeddd725d692b4c0be1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d20efa5e/uploads/origins/ea53